  "excerpt": "QEI invites early career optometrists to an exciting evening of retina education.",
  "body_html": "<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">Collect CPD points through interactive learning at QEI’s</h3>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #1b75bc;\"><strong>EYE SOLVED IT!<br/>\nOptometry clinical cases</strong></span></h2>\n<p> </p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Tuesday 11th August 2026</strong></h3>\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\"><img alt=\"Optometry Australia quality assurance badge offering four hours of CPD learning.\" class=\"wpa-warning wpa-image-missing-alt aligncenter wp-image-6741 size-medium\" data-warning=\"Missing alt text\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"300\" sizes=\"(max-width: 175px) 100vw, 175px\" src=\"../../wp-content/uploads/2026/07/4Ti-175x300.jpg\" srcset=\"../../wp-content/uploads/2026/07/4Ti-175x300.jpg 175w, ../../wp-content/uploads/2026/07/4Ti.jpg 375w\" width=\"175\"/></div>\n<p class=\"wp-block-image\">Collect CPD points at this free interactive education event hosted by QEI ophthalmologist. Our doctors will deliver a range of clinical cases on <strong>medical retina</strong>, <strong>corneal and orbital disease, glaucoma </strong>and<strong> post-cataract surgery complications. </strong>Participants will rotate through different cases and work together to uncover the mystery behind each condition.<img alt=\"Sign saying 'sorry registration closed'\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-6221\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"431\" id=\"longdesc-return-6221\" longdesc=\"https://qei.org.au?longdesc=6221&amp;referrer=6465\" sizes=\"(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px\" src=\"../../wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Registration-closed.png\" srcset=\"../../wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Registration-closed.png 500w, ../../wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Registration-closed-300x259.png 300w, ../../wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Registration-closed-348x300.png 348w\" tabindex=\"-1\" width=\"500\"/></p>\n<p> </p>",
  "details_html": "<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">Tuesday, 11th August 2026</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">5:45 pm – 8:30 pm</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">Queensland Eye Institute<br/>\n87 Ipswich Rd<br/>\nWoolloongabba</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/RuVkJp4Nz46vgF6j9\">View map</a></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">🍽️Dinner and drinks provided</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">🏆Awesome prizes to be won</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">🚗Parking available on-site (enter via Henry Street)</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">Numbers are strictly limited and registration is essential to secure your place.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"Sign saying 'sorry registration closed'\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-6221 size-medium\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"259\" id=\"longdesc-return-6221\" longdesc=\"https://qei.org.au?longdesc=6221&amp;referrer=6740\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" src=\"../../wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Registration-closed-300x259.png\" srcset=\"../../wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Registration-closed-300x259.png 300w, ../../wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Registration-closed-348x300.png 348w, ../../wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Registration-closed.png 500w\" tabindex=\"-1\" width=\"300\"/></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">All enquiries to Tina Huynh at <a href=\"mailto:education@qei.org.au\">education@qei.org.au</a></p>",
